  "source_ref": "Trenz TEIB0006-03 carrier schematic, FMC.SchDoc (p11) + FMC_MISC.SchDoc (p12). Carrier nets are pad-encoded for the TEI0006 micromodule Cyclone 10 GX (B2J/B2K_LVDSn = IO bank 2J/2K LVDS pair, GXBL1C/1D_TXn/RXn = transceiver channels); balls resolved via the 10CX220YF780 FPGA symbol sheets of the Altera DK-DEV-10CX220 schematic (same die/package as the TEI0006-03 10CX220YF780I5G; only temp grade differs). B2B reachability of LA/HA/CLK/DP nets confirmed on J9/J10/J11 sheets (p5-7). HA10-HA23, all HB, and CLK2/CLK3_BIDIR are not connected. GBTCLK0/1 are AC-coupled (100nF C15-C18) onto B2B J11 nets IN2/IN1 toward the module refclk inputs, but the module-side ball is not derivable from carrier docs alone - omitted. Sidebands: PRSNT/PG/JTAG go to B2B or pull resistors (module-side unknown), SCL/SDA tee to the SFP sheet I2C, CLK_DIR has only a 10K pulldown (R27) - all omitted. VREF/GA excluded per repo convention.",
